{"kind":"stack","id":"plants-life","title":"Plant needs: air, light, water, soil and room to grow","theme":{"background":"#f4fbf2","foreground":"#1f3b1c","font":"Trebuchet MS, sans-serif"}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c1-q","content":"Which gas do plants take in from the air to make food?"},{"type":"image","picto":"leaf"},{"type":"button","id":"c1-a","label":"Carbon dioxide","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c1-b","label":"Oxygen only","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c1-c","label":"Nitrogen","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c2-q","content":"What do plant roots mainly take in from the soil?"},{"type":"button","id":"c2-a","label":"Sunlight","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c2-b","label":"Water and nutrients","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c2-c","label":"Air bubbles","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c3","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c3-t","content":"Photosynthesis"},{"type":"text","id":"c3-e","content":"The way a plant uses sunlight, water and carbon dioxide to make its own food and release oxygen."},{"type":"button","id":"c3-b","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c4-q","content":"Which plant would most likely grow best in a dark cupboard?"},{"type":"button","id":"c4-a","label":"A plant that needs little light","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-b","label":"A tomato plant","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-c","label":"None of them, plants need light to make food","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c5-t","content":"Your class has a seedling. Where will you plant it so it can grow well?"},{"type":"button","id":"c5-a","label":"Sunny windowsill, with room to spread","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-b","label":"Dark corner, packed tightly with other plants","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c6-t","content":"The seedling grows tall and strong in the sunlight. Its roots have space to spread into the soil."},{"type":"button","id":"c6-b","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c7-t","content":"The seedling is crowded and pale. The other plants block its light and take the soil's water."},{"type":"button","id":"c7-b","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c8","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c8-t","content":"Nutrients"},{"type":"text","id":"c8-e","content":"Useful minerals in the soil that plants need to grow strong, such as nitrogen."},{"type":"button","id":"c8-b","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c9","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c9-q","content":"Do all plants need the same amount of water and light?"},{"type":"button","id":"c9-a","label":"Yes, every plant needs exactly the same","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"end"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-b","label":"No, different plants need different amounts","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"end"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-c","label":"Only plants in the desert need water","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"end"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"end","kind":"end","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"end-h","content":"You finished the plant needs stack!"},{"type":"text","id":"end-m","content":"Well done. Plants need air, light, water, nutrients from soil and room to grow, and each plant needs them in its own way."}],"actions":[]}}
